stateDiagram-v2
    state "Step 1: Intake — task registered" as INTAKE
    state "Step 2: Interview — understanding what you want" as INTERVIEW
    state "Step 3: Draft plan authored" as DRAFT_PLAN
    state "Step 4: Plan disposition & acceptance gate" as PLAN_REVIEW
    state "Step 4a: Independent plan review — 0 or more rounds" as MULTI_AGENT_REVIEW
    state "Step 5: Awaiting your approval" as AWAITING_APPROVAL
    state "Step 6: Approved — you said go" as APPROVED
    state "Step 7: Implementation (isolated worktree)" as IN_WORKTREE
    state "Step 8: Here's what changed — please review" as WORKTREE_REVIEW
    state "Step 8a: Multi-agent review of the code — 1 or N rounds (your choice)" as MULTI_AGENT_CODE_REVIEW
    state "Step 9: Verifying (tests, checks)" as VERIFY_EXIT
    state "Step 10: Retrospective — complete survey or explicitly skip with reason" as RETROSPECTIVE
    state "Step 11: Done" as DONE
    state "Rolled back — problem found, documented" as ROLLED_BACK
    state "Escalated to you for a decision" as ESCALATED

    [*] --> INTAKE
    INTAKE --> INTERVIEW
    INTAKE --> DRAFT_PLAN : skip straight to planning
    INTAKE --> PLAN_REVIEW : skip straight to planning
    INTAKE --> ESCALATED
    INTAKE --> DONE : force close — interactive human authorization

    INTERVIEW --> DRAFT_PLAN : interview complete<br/>no plan artifacts required yet
    INTERVIEW --> PLAN_REVIEW : legacy/direct plan submission path<br/>(artifacts required)
    INTERVIEW --> RETROSPECTIVE : trivial path — interview baseline<br/>and adaptive follow-ups complete
    INTERVIEW --> ESCALATED
    INTERVIEW --> INTAKE : human-approved recovery reset
    INTERVIEW --> DONE : force close — interactive human authorization

    DRAFT_PLAN --> PLAN_REVIEW : submit plan<br/>ask additional review? yes/no
    PLAN_REVIEW --> DRAFT_PLAN : changes requested<br/>revise artifact identity
    DRAFT_PLAN --> INTERVIEW : needs more questions
    PLAN_REVIEW --> INTERVIEW : needs more questions

    PLAN_REVIEW --> MULTI_AGENT_REVIEW : yes — choose review method<br/>repeat after each review if needed
    PLAN_REVIEW --> AWAITING_APPROVAL : no / plan accepted<br/>continue to human approval
    DRAFT_PLAN --> ESCALATED
    DRAFT_PLAN --> INTAKE : human-approved recovery reset
    DRAFT_PLAN --> DONE : force close — interactive human authorization
    PLAN_REVIEW --> ESCALATED
    PLAN_REVIEW --> INTAKE : human-approved recovery reset
    PLAN_REVIEW --> DONE : force close — interactive human authorization

    MULTI_AGENT_REVIEW --> PLAN_REVIEW : review complete<br/>merge outcomes for plan acceptance
    MULTI_AGENT_REVIEW --> DRAFT_PLAN : reviewer requested changes<br/>new identity required before resubmission
    MULTI_AGENT_REVIEW --> ESCALATED
    MULTI_AGENT_REVIEW --> INTAKE : human-approved recovery reset
    MULTI_AGENT_REVIEW --> DONE : force close — interactive human authorization

    AWAITING_APPROVAL --> APPROVED : you say Proceed / Go<br/>(this step can never be skipped)
    AWAITING_APPROVAL --> DRAFT_PLAN : needs more work
    AWAITING_APPROVAL --> PLAN_REVIEW : needs more work
    AWAITING_APPROVAL --> ESCALATED
    AWAITING_APPROVAL --> INTAKE : human-approved recovery reset
    AWAITING_APPROVAL --> DONE : force close — interactive human authorization

    APPROVED --> IN_WORKTREE
    APPROVED --> RETROSPECTIVE : human-approved skip implementation
    APPROVED --> ESCALATED
    APPROVED --> INTAKE : human-approved recovery reset
    APPROVED --> DONE : force close — interactive human authorization

    IN_WORKTREE --> WORKTREE_REVIEW : implementation + tests done
    IN_WORKTREE --> VERIFY_EXIT
    IN_WORKTREE --> ROLLED_BACK
    IN_WORKTREE --> ESCALATED
    IN_WORKTREE --> INTAKE : human-approved recovery reset
    IN_WORKTREE --> DONE : force close — interactive human authorization

    WORKTREE_REVIEW --> MULTI_AGENT_CODE_REVIEW : Want a second AI review<br/>of this code? Yes
    WORKTREE_REVIEW --> VERIFY_EXIT : Proceed straight<br/>to verification? Yes<br/>(skip recorded, never silent)
    WORKTREE_REVIEW --> IN_WORKTREE : more changes needed
    WORKTREE_REVIEW --> ROLLED_BACK
    WORKTREE_REVIEW --> ESCALATED
    WORKTREE_REVIEW --> INTAKE : human-approved recovery reset
    WORKTREE_REVIEW --> DONE : force close — interactive human authorization

    MULTI_AGENT_CODE_REVIEW --> WORKTREE_REVIEW
    MULTI_AGENT_CODE_REVIEW --> VERIFY_EXIT
    MULTI_AGENT_CODE_REVIEW --> IN_WORKTREE : reviewer requested changes
    MULTI_AGENT_CODE_REVIEW --> ROLLED_BACK
    MULTI_AGENT_CODE_REVIEW --> ESCALATED
    MULTI_AGENT_CODE_REVIEW --> INTAKE : human-approved recovery reset
    MULTI_AGENT_CODE_REVIEW --> DONE : force close — interactive human authorization

    VERIFY_EXIT --> RETROSPECTIVE : all checks passed
    VERIFY_EXIT --> IN_WORKTREE : verification failed
    VERIFY_EXIT --> WORKTREE_REVIEW : verification failed
    VERIFY_EXIT --> ROLLED_BACK
    VERIFY_EXIT --> ESCALATED
    VERIFY_EXIT --> INTAKE : human-approved recovery reset
    VERIFY_EXIT --> DONE : force close — interactive human authorization

    RETROSPECTIVE --> DONE : survey complete or explicitly skipped<br/>with reason<br/>follow-ups resolved
    RETROSPECTIVE --> ESCALATED : retrospective blocked
    RETROSPECTIVE --> INTAKE : human-approved recovery reset
    ROLLED_BACK --> ESCALATED
    ROLLED_BACK --> PLAN_REVIEW : restart planning
    ROLLED_BACK --> INTAKE : human-approved recovery reset
    ROLLED_BACK --> DONE : force close — interactive human authorization

    ESCALATED --> INTAKE : start over
    ESCALATED --> PLAN_REVIEW : restart planning
    ESCALATED --> DONE : force close — interactive human authorization

    DONE --> INTAKE : human-approved recovery reset
    DONE --> [*]

    note right of DONE
        Force-close from any state requires
        explicit human authorization.
        Agents cannot invoke this bypass.
    end note

    note right of IN_WORKTREE
        After APPROVED → IN_WORKTREE, the
        implementation controller runs dispatch,
        review, and bounded fixes without asking
        for lifecycle transitions. Re-enter only
        for exit verification, retrospective, or
        a human-authorized abort.
    end note
